TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="app/**, routes/**, config/**"

LANGUAGE_RUNTIME:
- PHP 8.3+ (fill in exact version)
- Laravel 11+ (fill in exact version)
- Composer for dependencies

BUILD:
- composer install
- php artisan config:cache (production)
- ./vendor/bin/pint for formatting
- ./vendor/bin/phpstan analyse for static analysis

STYLE_CONVENTIONS:
- Laravel Pint (PSR-12 + Laravel conventions) — do not hand-format
- PHPStan level 8 target (or fill in project level)
- Type declarations on all method parameters and return types
- Thin controllers — business logic in Action classes or Service layer
- Use Laravel's built-in features (Collections, Eloquent, Queue) before rolling custom

FORBIDDEN_PATTERNS:
- No raw SQL without DB::select with bound parameters
- No secrets in .env.example with real values
- No echo or var_dump() in production code — use logging
- No logic in Blade templates — move to view composers or components

EXPLICITLY_NOT_TOUCHING:
- (fill in: in-progress migrations, vendor/, storage/, etc.)
